# --- Credentials -------------------------------------------------------
# Globs, not exact names. The previous repo listed `api_key.txt` literally,
# which left api_key.txt.bak-* and mfds_api_key3/4.txt tracked by default.
*api_key*
*apikey*
*_key.txt
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
*secret*
*credential*

# --- Data --------------------------------------------------------------
# The reported 14,019-product cohort is not distributed; users supply their
# own food table via --food-df. Tracked here: the 104-product example drawn
# from the cohort, the two USDA reference tables the analysis used in full
# (thesaurus, top-100 profiles), the feature diagram and the README. The
# sampler that drew the example lives in nutpred/.
data/*
!data/food_df.example.csv
!data/thesaurus.xlsx
!data/ingnut_df.example.csv
!data/figure2.png
!data/README.md

# USDA FoodData Central bulk exports, wherever they are placed
food.csv
branded_food.csv
food_nutrient.csv
nutrient.csv
FoodData_Central_*

# --- Run outputs -------------------------------------------------------
test_*/
complete_*/
nutpred_outputs*/
outputs/
logs/
*.log
nohup.out

# Local experiment trees: frozen code copies, Optuna databases and result
# tables kept beside the repo for the manuscript revision. Not part of the
# release.
experiments/

# Figures and results are not distributed with the code, with one exception:
# the ingredient-feature diagram is documentation and is tracked.
figures/
*.png
!data/figure2.png
*.pdf
*.pptx

